1.33,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":1,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.1572,"r5":-0.1813,"r1_spy":-0.1603,"r5_spy":-0.2142}}],"quotes":[{"c":"HALO 2019 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Torley","x":"I'll then transition over to Laurie who will provide more detail on our third quarter financial results, the restructuring, our capital return plan, and 2019 updated guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2019 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurie D. Stelzer","x":"The restructuring costs of $25 million to $27 million will be booked in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2019 Q4","e":"halo","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Torley","x":"And I'd also like to just take a moment to thank Laurie for her contributions to Halozyme and particularly for the key role she played in helping the Company through the restructuring over the last few months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2019 Q4","e":"halo","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Torley","x":"The swift repositioning of the Company and the decisive cost reduction measures taken have placed Halozyme on a path to sustainable near-term profitability with anticipated high growth in revenues, earnings, and cash flows expected for the next several years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q1","e":"halo","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"The overall decrease in total operating expenses resulted from our shift in strategic focus to the company's ENHANZE drug delivery technology in November of last year and the related restructuring which has largely been completed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q1","e":"halo","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"SG&A expenses were $12.6 million, down from $18 million in the prior year, primarily due to the reduction in force and discontinuation of our PEGPH20 related launch expenses that were part of the restructuring initiated in November last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q1","e":"halo","d":"2020-05-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Helen Torley","x":"So in summary, based on all of the latest updates from our partners and suppliers as well as our planned expenditures, we feel confident maintaining our guidance for 2020 at this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q2","e":"halo","d":"2020-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"The overall decrease in total operating expenses resulted from our shift in strategic focus to the company's ENHANZE drug delivering technology in November of last year and related restructuring, which has now been completed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q2","e":"halo","d":"2020-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"We've been working to finalize the close out of remaining costs associated with our prior clinical trial activities and completed our restructuring of the company's operations in the second quarter to focus solely on ENHANZE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"The overall decrease in total operating expenses resulted from our shift in strategic focus to the company's ENHANZE drug delivery technology in November of 2019 and the related restructuring, which has now been completed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"And SG&A expenses were $11.7 million, down 35% from $18 million in the prior year, primarily due to the reduction in force and discontinuation of PEGPH20 related launch readiness expenses following the company's restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2020-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"Based on the latest information from our partners and our planned expenditures for the year, I'm pleased to share our increased guidance for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2020-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"We are increasing our guidance range to $0.80 to $0.85, up from our prior guidance range of $0.60 to $0.75.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q4","e":"halo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"That overall decrease in total operating expenses resulted from our shift in strategic focus, to an ENHANZE-only business model in November of 2019 and related restructuring, which has now been completed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2020 Q4","e":"halo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"And SG&A expenses were $10.4 million, down 56% and from $23.9 million in the prior year, primarily due to the reduction in force and discontinuation of PEGPH20-related launch readiness expenses following our restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2021 Q1","e":"halo","d":"2021-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"Consistent with the strong growth we're seeing for our business, we are reiterating our guidance for total revenues of $375 million to $395 million, which would represent year-over-year growth of 40% to 48%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2021 Q2","e":"halo","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elaine Sun","x":"We are pleased to be raising guidance for 2021 based on our latest collaboration with Viiv and the strong results so far in the first half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2021 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elaine D. Sun","x":"What I would remind folks is that we did raise guidance by $50 million in the second quarter, and we're pleased that given the strong results in the third quarter, we were able to, again, raise guidance by increasing that lower end of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/halozyme-therapeutics-inc-halo-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"HALO 2025 Q3","e":"halo","d":"2025-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nicole LaBrosse","x":"Based on our strong performance year to date, we are raising our guidance ranges for the full 